ull},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-02-20T15:33:15Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T19:48:32Z","closed_at":"2025-02-20T19:47:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in 4.3.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono - Windows 10.0.22631 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600 6-Core Processor (12 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nShaders with cull disabled do not get their triangles sorted correctly under certain view angles if the shader has transparency. \n\nI'm not sure if this is even supposed to work, but I can do it without any warning and it works half the time, which leads me to believe that flipping some number based on view angle could make this work all of the time. \n\nThis can also be worked around by splitting the shader into multiple passes.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe minimal reproduction shader is quite simple:\n```glsl\nshader_type spatial;\nrender_mode cull_disabled;\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tif (FRONT_FACING) {\n\t\tALPHA = 0.5;\n\t}\n}\n```\n\nJust add it to a mesh and view it from different angles to see the issue.\n\nVideo example:\n![video](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f5103d52-7835-4b03-b55c-2643af78bf55)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAdded example project, it contains a test scene with a mesh with a minimal shader that demonstrates the issue:\n\n[zsortbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18888734/zsortbug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103076/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}